---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Logo from '@sierragridteam/design-system/components/Logo.astro';
import Button from '@sierragridteam/design-system/components/Button.astro';
import '../styles/fieldnotes.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Crossing" description="A live reading of the Sierra. Follow weather, roads, fire decisions, power, earth and radio observations back to their evidence.">
<a class="skip" href="#reading">Skip to reading</a>
<header>
<Logo siteName="Grid" href="/" />
<span class="edition">CROSSING / A SIERRA OBSERVATORY</span>
<a href="?chapter=sources" class="source-link">Behind the reading ↗</a>
</header>
<div class="book">
<aside class="margin">
<p class="eyebrow">Look closer</p>
<nav id="chapters" aria-label="Chapters">
</nav>
<div class="margin-note">
<span class="asterisk">✳</span>
<p>Every crossing has more than one story.</p>
<small>Follow the evidence.<br/>Keep its limits in view.</small>
</div>
</aside>
<main id="reading">
<section class="opening">
<div class="issue">
<span>SIERRA NEVADA · CALAVERAS & BEYOND</span>
<span id="edition-date">
</span>
</div>
<h1>Between foothill<br/>&amp; <em>high country.</em>
</h1>
<p class="dek">Move through a landscape of observations. Pause at a place. Follow what the sky, the ground, and the people’s infrastructure reveal.</p>
<div class="crossing">
<div class="crossing-label">
<span class="eyebrow">AN OBSERVATIONAL TRANSECT</span>
<span>Foothills → Mountain pass</span>
</div>
<nav id="stops" aria-label="Stops along the crossing">
</nav>
<label class="slider-label" for="crossing-position">Move through the crossing</label>
<input id="crossing-position" type="range" min="0" max="4" value="0" step="1" aria-valuetext="Murphys"/>
<small>Named places, not a computed driving route. Select a stop to change the reading below.</small>
</div>
<div class="place-line">
<label for="place">Or explore a different place</label>
<select id="place" aria-label="Place">
<option value="ebbetts-pass">Ebbetts Pass</option>
</select>
<Button id="place-note" variant="ghost" size="sm">About this place ↗</Button>
</div>
<div id="connections">
</div>
<p id="reading-note" class="note">Retrieving a live reading…</p>
</section>
<section class="chapter">
<div class="chapter-title">
<span id="chapter-number">01</span>
<div>
<p class="eyebrow" id="chapter-kicker">THE SKY</p>
<h2 id="question">What is the air telling us?</h2>
</div>
</div>
<p id="chapter-intro" class="intro">
</p>
<nav id="collections" aria-label="Explore this chapter">
</nav>
<div id="controls">
</div>
<div id="evidence" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true">
</div>
</section>
<footer>
<p>Observations, not an all-clear.</p>
<small>Live public data from SIERRA. No automatic refresh. Weather forecasts are predictions; event revisions are stored changes, not continuous measurements. For urgent decisions, follow official sources.</small>
<a href="?chapter=sources">Read the sources and limits →</a>
</footer>
</main>
</div>
<dialog id="detail" aria-labelledby="detail-title">
<div class="detail-toolbar">
<span class="eyebrow">CROSSING / EVIDENCE</span>
<Button id="close-detail" variant="outline" size="sm">Close ×</Button>
</div>
<div id="detail-content">
</div>
</dialog>
<script>import '../lib/fieldnotes';</script>
</BaseLayout>
